---
title: "Where should period-note bank charts live?"
accTitle: "Placement of period-note bank charts"
accDescr: "Daily notes keep the Bank Badge. Period notes get an own money plot, mounted as a sibling host after the stats strip and badge inside the existing bob-stats-strip fence."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 16
    nodeSpacing: 18
    wrappingWidth: 220
---
flowchart TD
  Q{{"`**Which note?**`"}}
  BADGE["`**Daily**<br/>Bank Badge only`"]
  subgraph PERIOD["Period note"]
    direction TB
    UNITS["`**Own money plot**<br/>Cents off minutes`"]
    FENCE["`**Existing fence**<br/>bob-stats-strip`"]
    HOST["`**Sibling host**<br/>After strip and badge`"]
    UNITS --> FENCE
    FENCE --> HOST
  end
  Q -->|daily| BADGE
  Q -->|"week, quarter, year, all time"| UNITS
  classDef decision fill:#FFF7E6,stroke:#C77C02,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#4A3000
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  class Q decision
  class BADGE,UNITS,FENCE outcome
  class HOST focus
  style PERIOD fill:none,stroke:#2E7D4F
